##Mahabharata - Adi Parva - Chapter Topics##
Adau ma~NgalAcharaNaM .. 1 ..
naimishAraNye dIrghasatre shaunakAdInprati sauterAgamanam .. 2 ..
tatra shaunakAdibhiH sautiM prati bhAratakathanachodanA .. 3 ..
sautinA shrImannArAyaNanamaskArapUrvakaM vyAsasya bhAratanirmANakathanam .. 4 ..
parvAnukramaNikA .. 5 ..

##Mahabharata - Adi Parva - Chapter Text##

1\-1\-0 (0)
.. shrIvedavyAsAya namaH .. 1\-1\-0x (0)
