sandhyopAsanAdiH. prasahya prakarSheNa soDhvA kShudhAdiduHkhamapi
soDhvA. vittasya AharaNaM shilo~nChAdinA arjanaM. tAnyeva
tapaAdInyeva bhAvena phalAnusandhAnena upahatAni pratiShiddhAni. kalkaH
pApahetuH. tathAchAtrApi mokShadharmAdiShu tatratatra niShkAmakarmaNAM
pratipAdanaM brahmanirUpaNaM chAstyeva. ato vedAdapyuttamaM bhArataM ..
301 ..
iti TippaNe prathamo.adhyAyaH ..
