. mantrali~NgamAtrAvagamAttuShTAva. visheShashAnaM tu tasya
gurumukhAdeva bhaviShyati. atra chakre. nityaM charati bhramati. dhruve
pravAharUpeNa nitye kAlarUpe. shatAni ShaShTishcha ahorAtrANAmiti
