1\-62\-0 (2444)
janamejaya uvAcha. 1\-62\-0x (298)
kathitaM vai samAsena tvayA sarvaM dvijottama .
mahAbhAratamAkhyAnaM kurUNAM charitaM mahat .. 1\-62\-1 (2445)
kathAM tvanagha chitrArthAM kathayasva tapodhana .
