kathaM dharmabhR^itAM shreShThaH suto dharmasya dharmavit .
anarhaH paramaM kleshaM soDhavAnsa yudhiShThiraH .. 1\-62\-9 (2453)
kathaM cha bahulAH senAH pANDavaH kR^iShNasArathiH .
