dadR^ishuryAnamukhyAni dAshArhapuravAsinAm .. 1\-246\-21 (10675)
tataH puravare yUnAM puMsAM vAcha udIritAH .
arjune pratiyAti sma ashrUyanta samantataH .. 1\-246\-22 (10676)
pravAsAdAgataM pArthaM dR^iShTvA svamiva bAndhavam .
so.abhigamya narashreShTho dAshArhashatasaMvR^itaH.  1\-246\-23 (10677)
