yamAbhyAM vandito hR^iShTaH sasvaje tau nananda cha .
brAhmaNapramukhAnsarvAnbhrAtR^ibhiH saha sa~NgataH .. 1\-246\-26 (10680)
yathArhaM mAnayAmAsa paurajAnapadAnapi .
tatrasthAnyanuyAtAni tIrthAnyAyatanAni cha .. 1\-246\-27 (10681)
nivedayAmAsa tadA rAj~ne sarvaM svanuShThitam .
